OL,3,AGandhi's handwritten notes on life sold
OL,4,Afor $1.69m at Indian auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rare collection of handwritten notes
OL,7,Fby Indian independence leader Mahatma
OL,8,FGandhi has been sold for $1.69m (#1.3m)
OL,9,Fat an auction in Mumbai city.
OL,11,FThe notes, owned and preserved by the
OL,12,Ffamily of close associate and freedom
OL,13,Ffighter Anand T Hingorani, include 688
OL,14,Fof Gandhi's handwritten messages on
OL,15,Ftruth, non-violence and self-restraint
OL,16,Fwritten between 1944 and 1946.
OL,18,FAuction house Saffronart said the sale
OL,19,Fset a record for the highest price paid
OL,20,Ffor an Indian historical document at an
OL,21,Fauction.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
