OL,3,AGandhi's handwritten notes on life sold
OL,4,Afor $1.69m at Indian auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FGandhi led India's non-violent struggle
OL,7,Fagainst British rule and is fondly
OL,8,Fknown as the father of the nation. But
OL,9,Fthe notes offer a more personal glimpse
OL,10,Fof the man behind the political leader.
